        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1240_4133.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fründtlich willig diennst, sampt was wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eren</unclear>,
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots vermögend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, frommen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ersamen</unclear>, Wysen
<lb n="3"/>sonnders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> fründ, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> Eidtgnossen.
<lb n="4"/>Wir habenn üwer schrybenn unnd die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vmbstendtlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitthäy</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/>lung, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochwichtigenn</unclear>, doch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbewüstenn</unclear> sach so die Post-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verfertigung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vff</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-280" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hispannien</unclear></placeName>, gann <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-311" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Meylandt</unclear></placeName> unnd
<lb n="7"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-55" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rom</unclear></placeName> dannen (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzeig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwenet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschrey</unclear> unnd
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürschyn</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebracht</unclear>) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mict</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonnderem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dannk</unclear>, unnd guot-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annmuothung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollmeinung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gunsts</unclear>, und ver-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">truwenligkheyt</unclear>, by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeigerenn</unclear> diß Brieffs empfang.
<lb n="11"/>Was aber die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angedüttet</unclear> sach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">möchte</unclear>, gibt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermuoth</unclear>-
<lb n="12"/>tung, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wunderbar</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethet</unclear>, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aller</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jüngst</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-131" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Franck-
<lb n="13"/>rych</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vergangenn</unclear> sin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soll</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachgvolgter</unclear> Rustung unnd
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zugsamen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Denngllich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daselbs</unclear> execution. (vonn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derenn</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>wir vor Acht tagenn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zyttung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekommen</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jetzunder</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>confirmiert wirtt. Dann wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hievohr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">menkhigklich</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>gedenckenn, dassellig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vngloubsam</unclear> gehaltenn, Der-
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halbenn</unclear> ouch niemandts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darvon</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uskhünd</unclear>, oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitthäy</unclear>-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllenn</unclear>, So unns aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hütt</unclear> vonn etlichen
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orthenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">har</unclear>, söllichs wyther <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezügets</unclear> wordenn.
<lb n="21"/>Habenn wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnderlassenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllenn</unclear>, uch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotter</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwer</unclear> Correspondentz, nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hieby</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ligender</unclear> Copijen,
<lb n="23"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">empfangnen</unclear> berichten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mittzetheylenn</unclear>.
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ob</unclear> woll by unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khein</unclear> zwyffell, Ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdind</unclear> deß
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allers</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">albereitt</unclear>, oder ehr dan uch diß von unns
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuokhomen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirdt</unclear>, vonn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annderenn</unclear> Orthenn
<lb n="27"/>erlangt habenn, Dennocht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> hiemit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsere</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotwilligkheyt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erwyßenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllenn</unclear>. Dann
<lb n="29"/>üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwenn</unclear> liebenn Eidtgnossen
<lb n="30"/>fründtschafft liebe unnd gefallen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerzeygenn</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sind</unclear> wir Jeder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zytt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geneygt</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="32"/><origDate when="1588-12-28" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">28ten</unclear> Decembr. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1588</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="33"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-514" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuldtheis</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rhatt</unclear>
<lb n="34"/>der Statt Bernn</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1240_4134.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1240_4135.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1240_4136.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="35"/>Den fromen fuersichtigenn
<lb n="36"/>ersammen wysen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger-
<lb n="37"/>meyster unnd Rhatt der Statt
<lb n="38"/>Sant Gallenn</orgName>, unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear>-
<lb n="39"/>sonders guotten fruenden, unnd
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getruewen</unclear> lieben Eidtgnossen.
</p>
